    "updated_at": "2022-05-24T07:33:33Z",
    "body": "So we already state that entries have a name, but it seems that isn't the full location. Can we give entries an additional field, called \"path\" or \"location\" that is a string or byte sequence or implementation-defined type representing a location on disk? And then we build the other things on top of that. I typically find that making the conceptual model explicit in terms of data structures makes it easy to build processing models on top.",
